From 3aebad8a419a0cd7ab805bb228bf599714177e54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RT-N10 build <rtn10@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:43:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: add Ralink RT3050/RT3350 frame engine and
 switch driver; MIPS: dts: add ASUS RT-N10 B1

---
